# Example

This folder provides a minimal example for running the software.

## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Required Data

Download the processed datasets from the Zenodo archive:

https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15616826

Place the required input files in the project directory.

## Run

```bash
python 3d_los.py
```

For validation:

```bash
jupyter notebook validation_gnss.ipynb
```
